        "id": 1836235
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-10-02T07:59:38Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I\u0027m not quite sure what you mean here, but the updated API allows for specification of the AAD (and the nonce) so does now implement AEAD functionality.",
      "parentUuid": "350cb7dd_13053bba",
      "revId": "4acc9bd1172d2be32b3a0474fd4892f7840bc6c4",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
