      "author": {
        "id": 1958315
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-09-28T15:07:03Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "No. It\u0027s just to make sure that the buffer is large enough. The check is here [1].\n\n[1] http://google3/third_party/openssl/boringssl/src/crypto/fipsmodule/cipher/aead.c;l\u003d123;rcl\u003d429113831",
