      "writtenOn": "2023-09-28T15:07:03Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The policy is checked in BoringSSL [1], same for the one above. Later I\u0027ll add the logic to retrieve the BoringSSL error stack, and we should raise it together with the API name.\n\n[1] http://google3/third_party/openssl/boringssl/src/crypto/fipsmodule/cipher/aead.c;l\u003d213;rcl\u003d429113831",
